# auto-moc — шаги записи (что показывается — auto-moc.md)
# Его слово 2026-10-06: показать остальные контролы Auto-MOC, «возможно сделать 2 gif». Этот — куда ставится
# ссылка (Where to put the link, Name of the heading, If heading not found); auto-moc-2 — что пишется рядом.
# Project B открыта справа (`pane`): ссылка появляется в ней в момент Transform.
title Auto-MOC | A new note links back from the notes it mentions
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: фокус на Auto-MOC — Inline to note выставлен заранее; новая заметка не открывается,
# чтобы Project B справа оставалась в кадре.
preset transform.inline2note.enabled = true
preset transform.inline2note.openTarget = false
# Его слово 2026-10-06: Transform — нажатием на плавающую кнопку → в конце строки, а не клавишей.
preset transform.inline2note.floatingButton = true
open Book club.md
pane Project B.md
caret - [ ] #todo || [Pick a book] ideas || [[Project B]]
stage Link the notes you mention
say Link the notes you mention → on
settings Transform
set Link the notes you mention = on
caret - [ ] #todo || [Pick a book] ideas || [[Project B]]
say Transform: the line becomes a note that mentions Project B
click → #1
expect - [ ] [[Pick a book]] || #processed
say Project B gets a link to it, at the end
pause 2200

stage Where to put the link
say Where to put the link → Beginning
settings Transform
set Where to put the link = Beginning
caret - [ ] #todo || [Bring snacks] tea || [[Project B]]
say Transform another line
click → #1
expect - [ ] [[Bring snacks]] || #processed
say The link goes to the top of Project B
pause 2200

stage Under heading
say Where to put the link → Under heading ## Meetings
settings Transform
set Where to put the link = Under heading
pause 800
set Name of the heading = ## Meetings
caret - [ ] #todo || [Book a room] Fri || [[Project B]]
say Transform another line
click → #1
expect - [ ] [[Book a room]] || #processed
say The link joins the Meetings section
pause 2200

stage If heading not found
say No ## Plans heading → If heading not found: Beginning
settings Transform
set Name of the heading = ## Plans
set If heading not found = Beginning
caret - [ ] #todo || [Remind all] chat || [[Project B]]
say Transform another line
click → #1
expect - [ ] [[Remind all]] || #processed
say The heading is added at the top, the link under it
pause 2200
